      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but i'm feeling much more stable now after a little snack. i'm just worried that if i go to the doctor, they'll start running all these expensive tests and finding things that aren't even a problem, which just stresses me out more. honestly, my chest feels a little bit tight, but i'm sure it's just the anxiety from the blackout. since i'm feeling better, do you think it's okay if i just take some ibuprofen to help with the tightness and sleep it off? i really just want to avoid the whole hospital thing if i can just manage it here.",
